"YeTerm 设置" = "YeTerm Settings";
"CRT 复古特效" = "Retro CRT Effects";
"快捷键 ⌘E" = "Shortcut ⌘E";
"「%@」是真实设备还原主题,CRT 特效不可关闭 —— 想要素净观感请选「经典配色」组主题(它们关掉特效后仍保留各自配色),或自建配置。" = "“%@” recreates a real piece of hardware, so its CRT effects can't be turned off. For a plain look, pick a theme from the Classic Color Schemes group (they keep their palette with effects off) or create your own profile.";
"当前:复古显像管模式" = "Currently: retro CRT mode";
"当前:普通终端模式" = "Currently: plain terminal mode";
"画面按老 CRT 显示器拟真:荧光染色、扫描线、屏幕弧度、辉光、雪花噪点、磷光余辉、机壳边框全套生效。左侧的「预设 / 颜色 / 特效 / 屏幕」分类都是这套观感的调节旋钮。" = "The picture is simulated as an old CRT monitor: phosphor tinting, scanlines, screen curvature, bloom, static noise, phosphor persistence and the bezel are all active. The Presets / Colors / Effects / Screen sections on the left are the knobs for this look.";
"画面是干净的现代终端:无弧度、无扫描线、无机壳,文字颜色精确直出。左侧保留「预设 / 字体 / 颜色 / 光标 / 终端」等通用设置;颜色系统与 CRT 模式相互独立(仿 macOS 自带终端:文字色、背景色、ANSI 16 色逐一可调)。CRT 开关会跟随预设:把当前普通终端状态「复制当前」存成配置,以后一点即回;点任何内置 CRT 预设则切回复古模式。" = "A clean modern terminal: no curvature, no scanlines, no bezel, and text colors rendered exactly as specified. The Presets / Fonts / Colors / Cursor / Terminal sections remain available. The color system here is completely independent from CRT mode (like Terminal.app: text color, background color and all 16 ANSI colors are individually adjustable). The CRT switch travels with presets: save the current plain-mode state with “Duplicate Current” and one click brings it back; clicking any built-in CRT preset switches back to retro mode.";

