"总开关(⌘E)。关闭 = 当成普通终端用:原生文字渲染,仅字体与前景/背景色生效" = "Master switch (⌘E). Off = use it as a plain terminal: native text rendering, with only the font and foreground/background colors applied.";
"文字发光" = "Text Glow";
"拆成两半独立调:**白热化** = 笔画自己被打得过狠而发白(就地,不影响周围);**辉光** = 光散射出去把周围照亮(一圈磷光色的晕)。想要「中心发白」调上面那个,不必再把辉光开到最大。" = "Two independent halves: **Overdrive** = the stroke itself is driven so hard it goes white (in place, doesn't touch its surroundings); **Bloom** = light scattering outward to light up the area around it (a halo in the phosphor color). For a white-hot core, use the first one — you no longer need to crank bloom to the maximum.";
"白热化" = "Overdrive";
"发白起点" = "Overdrive Knee";
"从多亮开始发白。调低=连中等亮度的笔画也泛白;调高=只有最亮的芯部发白、边缘保持磷光色。" = "How bright a pixel must be before it starts whitening. Lower = even mid-bright strokes wash out; higher = only the brightest core goes white while the edges keep the phosphor color.";
"辉光" = "Bloom";
"辉光风格" = "Bloom Style";
"柔雾" = "Soft haze";
"光晕" = "Halation";
"柔雾=能量守恒的模糊(原版,更接近实测);光晕=亮核峰值不衰减" = "Soft haze = energy-preserving blur (the original behavior, closer to measurements); Halation = the bright core keeps its peak brightness";
"光晕形状" = "Bloom Shape";
"单层" = "Single";
"紧核+长尾" = "Tight core + long tail";
"真 CRT 的光晕衰减比指数快、比高斯慢(玻璃多次散射 + 眼内杂散光)。紧核+长尾=光更贴笔画、远处更干净" = "A real CRT's halo falls off faster than an exponential but slower than a Gaussian (multiple scattering in the glass plus veiling glare in the eye). Tight core + long tail hugs the strokes more closely and keeps distant areas cleaner.";
"余辉" = "Persistence";
"雪花噪点" = "Static Noise";
"画面闪烁" = "Flicker";
"发光模型" = "Emission Model";
"颜料" = "Pigment";
"自发光" = "Emissive";
"自发光:叠加的光不砍平,溢出按色相等比压缩 —— 亮处保持纯磷光色、不发白。注意:实测真 CRT 照片的亮处**是会发白的**(最亮处饱和度只剩 0.11),所以这一档偏「理想磷光体」而非「照片写实」。" = "Emissive: added light isn't clipped; overflow is scaled down while preserving hue, so highlights keep a pure phosphor color instead of washing out. Note: in actual photographs of real CRTs highlights **do** wash out (saturation drops to 0.11 at the brightest point), so this setting is “idealized phosphor” rather than photo-realistic.";
"颜料(推荐):cool-retro-term 原版语义 —— 亮处逐通道饱和后褪色发白。与真 CRT 照片的实测走向一致(饱和度随亮度先升后降),笔画中心高亮偏白、边缘渐变回绿。" = "Pigment (recommended): the original cool-retro-term behavior — highlights saturate per channel and then wash toward white. This matches what real CRT photos show (saturation rises with brightness, then falls), giving strokes a white-hot center that fades back to green at the edges.";
