// ── Preset blurbs (Presets.swift) ───────────────────────────────────────────
"琥珀磷光(P3)单色屏,80 年代文字终端最常见的暖色,据说比绿屏更护眼——当年的\"深色模式之争\"。" = "Amber phosphor (P3) monochrome. The most common warm tint on 1980s text terminals, said to be easier on the eyes than green — the dark-mode debate of its day.";
"绿磷光(P1)单色屏,大众印象里\"终端\"的原型。黑底绿字加上轻微闪烁与噪点,是机房与黑客电影的共同记忆。" = "Green phosphor (P1) monochrome — the archetypal \"terminal\" in the popular imagination. Green on black with a touch of flicker and noise: the shared memory of machine rooms and hacker movies.";
"1982 年,史上最畅销的家用电脑(约 1700 万台)。VIC-II 显示芯片标志性的蓝底淡紫字,配原机字库字体,开机画面 READY. 是一代人的起点。" = "1982, the best-selling home computer ever (~17 million units). The VIC-II chip's signature light-purple-on-blue, with the machine's own character ROM font. Its READY. prompt was where a generation started.";
"1977 年\"三位一体\"(与 Apple ][、TRS-80 同年)之一,金属一体机+内置绿屏。原机字库+宽字符(fontWidth 1.25)还原。" = "One of the 1977 \"Trinity\" (alongside the Apple ][ and TRS-80): an all-metal all-in-one with a built-in green screen. Recreated with its original character ROM and wide glyphs (fontWidth 1.25).";
"1977 年个人电脑革命的起点,乔布斯车库传奇的主角。绿磷光+原机点阵字体。" = "1977, where the personal computer revolution began and the Jobs garage legend was born. Green phosphor with the machine's original bitmap font.";
"1979 年 Atari 8-bit 家族入门机,薄膜键盘+电视输出。蓝底浅蓝的柔和感来自家用电视的低通滤波,配原机字库。" = "1979, the entry model of Atari's 8-bit family: membrane keyboard, TV output. The soft light-blue-on-blue comes from a home TV's low-pass filtering. Uses the machine's own character ROM.";
"1987 年 IBM PS/2 带来的 VGA 文本模式:80×25、9×16 点阵、灰白字。DOS 时代装机自带的\"素颜\",配原版 VGA 字模。" = "The VGA text mode the 1987 IBM PS/2 brought: 80×25, a 9×16 cell, off-white text. The bare face every DOS-era machine shipped with, using the original VGA font.";
"1972 年起服役的 IBM 3270 系大型机终端。无弧度无噪点——机房级硬件的冷静绿,和家用机的花哨是两个世界。" = "The IBM 3270-series mainframe terminal, in service from 1972. No curvature, no noise — the composed green of machine-room hardware, a world away from flashy home computers.";
"1981 年 IBM PC 原配单色显示器,P39 长余辉绿磷光——字符移动会拖出绿色残影,burn-in 调高正是还原这条尾巴。配 IBM PC 原版字模。" = "The monochrome display the 1981 IBM PC shipped with. P39 long-persistence green phosphor — moving characters drag a green trail behind them, which is exactly what the high persistence setting recreates. Uses the original IBM PC font.";
"1978 年 DEC 出品,史上影响力最大的终端——今天所有终端软件(包括本 app)都在模拟它的转义序列。P4 白磷光,航母级机壳。" = "DEC, 1978 — the most influential terminal ever made. Every terminal program today (this one included) still emulates its escape sequences. P4 white phosphor in a battleship-grade case.";
"1983 年 VT100 继任者:屏更平、字更锐、闪烁更少。琥珀磷光是当年办公室的\"护眼款\"选配。" = "The 1983 successor to the VT100: flatter screen, sharper glyphs, less flicker. Amber phosphor was the office \"easy on the eyes\" option of the day.";
"1984 年初代 Mac 的 9 英寸屏:黑字白底模拟纸张,和当年清一色黑底终端唱反调。配 Monaco——初代 Mac 的原装等宽字体。" = "The 9-inch screen of the original 1984 Mac: black on white to imitate paper, deliberately at odds with the uniformly dark terminals of its time. Paired with Monaco, the first Mac's own monospace font.";
"1981 年史上第一台\"便携\"电脑:11 公斤手提箱,5 英寸小绿屏挤在两个软驱中间。超高弧度+小点阵字体还原贴脸看小屏的感觉。" = "1981, the first \"portable\" computer: an 11 kg suitcase with a 5-inch green screen wedged between two floppy drives. Heavy curvature and a tiny bitmap font recreate the experience of squinting at it up close.";
"1984 年欧洲国民学习机,标配 GT65 绿屏——比接电视清楚,比彩显便宜,课桌上的绿色方块字。" = "1984, Europe's everyman learning machine, sold with the GT65 green monitor — clearer than a TV, cheaper than color. The green blocky letters of a school desk.";
"1982 年英国 8-bit 国民机,靠射频线接家用电视——色散与雪花是那根 RF 线的\"味道\"(v1.2 打磨:保留味道、收敛晃动)。浅底黑字还原 BASIC 屏。" = "Britain's 1982 people's 8-bit machine, connected to a home TV over an RF cable — the color fringing and static are that cable's flavor (tuned in v1.2 to keep the flavor but calm the wobble). Dark on light recreates its BASIC screen.";
"DOS 时代的\"工作蓝\":QBasic、EDIT、Norton Commander 的经典蓝底白字,一代人的编程启蒙背景色。配原版 VGA 字模。" = "The working blue of the DOS era: the white-on-blue of QBasic, EDIT and Norton Commander — the background color a generation learned to program against. Uses the original VGA font.";
"1974 年存储管图形终端:图形画上去就\"存\"在荧光屏上、不需刷新。burn-in 拉到最满,致敬这块不会忘记的屏。" = "A 1974 storage-tube graphics terminal: whatever you drew stayed on the phosphor without any refresh. Persistence is set to maximum in tribute to the screen that never forgets.";
"1980 年 RadioShack 百万销量神机(Model I 改进型),自带微微偏蓝的白磷光屏,平价电脑的第一缕冷光。" = "RadioShack's million-selling 1980 machine (a refined Model I), with a slightly blue-tinted white phosphor screen — the first cool glow of affordable computing.";
"1987 年多媒体霸主 Amiga 家族的国民机型,Workbench 系统标志性的蓝底白字橙点缀。轻微色散还原 RGB 彩显的观感。" = "The everyman model of the 1987 Amiga family, multimedia king of its day. Workbench's signature white-on-blue with orange accents. A touch of color fringing recreates the look of an RGB monitor.";
"1981 年英国 BBC 电脑扫盲计划的官方机器,一代英国程序员的启蒙。电视输出的白字黑底 + Mode 7 图文电视的味道。" = "The official machine of the BBC's 1981 Computer Literacy Project, where a generation of British programmers began. White on black over TV output, with a hint of Mode 7 teletext.";
"1978 年日本\"御三家\"之一(与 NEC、日立并称),一体机内置 10 英寸绿屏。日系早期个人电脑的方正绿字。" = "1978, one of Japan's \"big three\" (alongside NEC and Hitachi): an all-in-one with a built-in 10-inch green screen. The square green letterforms of early Japanese personal computing.";
"冷调蓝白荧光,保留 ANSI 彩色(chroma 全开)。不对应具体设备的冷色氛围创作。" = "A cool blue-white phosphor that keeps full ANSI color (chroma wide open). An original cool-toned mood piece, not a specific machine.";
"现代霓虹风创作:高辉光青色荧光+半透明窗口,赛博都市夜景的配色。" = "A modern neon original: heavy bloom on cyan phosphor with a translucent window — the palette of a cyber city at night.";
"低对比灰+高透明度,\"幽灵\"一样安静地叠在桌面上——适合当常驻的监控窗。" = "Low-contrast grey at high transparency, sitting over your desktop as quietly as a ghost — good as an always-on monitoring window.";
"等离子粉紫+高辉光+色散,合成器浪潮(Synthwave)审美的终端演绎。" = "Plasma pink-purple with heavy bloom and color fringing: synthwave aesthetics rendered as a terminal.";
"名字即注释:全部特效关到最低的纯白字+系统字体。对照组,也是排查\"这是特效问题还是内容问题\"的基准。" = "The name says it all: every effect at minimum, plain white text in a system font. A control group, and the baseline for telling \"is this the effects or the content?\" apart.";
"电子墨水风:米白纸底+深灰字,高余辉模拟墨水屏的残影。类纸阅读感,白天最舒服的一档。" = "E-paper style: warm white paper with dark grey text, high persistence standing in for e-ink ghosting. Paper-like and the most comfortable option in daylight.";
"《黑客帝国》数字雨绿(#00ff41)。配轻扫描线与余辉,ANSI 16 色也是全绿单色阶(层次靠亮度,连报错都是绿的)——Wake up, Neo." = "The digital-rain green of The Matrix (#00ff41), with light scanlines and persistence. Even the 16 ANSI colors are a single green ramp (depth comes from brightness — errors are green too). Wake up, Neo.";
"2011 年 Ethan Schoonover 用色彩学精密设计的低对比配色,十几年长盛不衰的程序员护眼圣经。暗色版,带官方 ANSI 表。" = "Ethan Schoonover's 2011 low-contrast palette, precision-designed from color science and still a programmer's eye-comfort gospel a decade later. The dark variant, with the official ANSI table.";
"Solarized 的浅色版:米黄纸底,长时间白天工作的经典选择。带官方 ANSI 表。" = "The light variant of Solarized: a cream paper background, a classic for long daytime sessions. Includes the official ANSI table.";
"2013 年诞生的暗色顶流,吸血鬼紫底+柔和高亮,官网口号\"Dark theme for everyone\"。带官方 ANSI 表。" = "The dark-theme superstar born in 2013: vampire purple with soft highlights, marketed as \"a dark theme for everyone\". Includes the official ANSI table.";
"北极风配色:蓝灰基调冷静克制,源自\"北极、冰雪、极光\"的意象,近年极简派最爱。带官方 ANSI 表。" = "An arctic palette: restrained blue-greys drawn from imagery of the far north, ice and the aurora. A recent favorite among minimalists. Includes the official ANSI table.";
"复古暖色系:低饱和奶油黄配深棕底,故意做旧的\"复古显示器\"质感——配位图字体加倍做旧,Vim 圈经典。带官方 ANSI 表。" = "Retro warmth: desaturated cream yellow on deep brown, deliberately aged into a \"vintage monitor\" feel — pair it with a bitmap font to age it further. A Vim-community classic. Includes the official ANSI table.";
"东京夜景配色:深蓝夜空底+霓虹柔光字,VS Code 上的现代人气王。带官方 ANSI 表。" = "Tokyo at night: a deep blue sky background with softly glowing neon text. A modern favorite on VS Code. Includes the official ANSI table.";
"2004 年起 Linux 桌面的第一印象:紫红 aubergine(茄皮紫)终端底色,开源世界的官方色。带官方 ANSI 表。" = "The first impression of the Linux desktop since 2004: the aubergine terminal background that became open source's official color. Includes the official ANSI table.";
"2021 年爆红的\"猫布奇诺\"奶咖配色,柔和低饱和的粉彩系,GitHub 星数最高的主题项目之一。Mocha 是四口味中最深的一档。" = "The \"cat-puccino\" latte palette that took off in 2021: soft, low-saturation pastels, and one of the most-starred theme projects on GitHub. Mocha is the darkest of its four flavors.";
"Atom 编辑器的遗产:GitHub 出品的经典暗色,红绿黄蓝紫五色平衡,被移植到几乎所有编辑器与终端。" = "The legacy of the Atom editor: GitHub's classic dark theme, balanced across red, green, yellow, blue and purple, and ported to nearly every editor and terminal since.";
"2006 年 Wimer Hazenberg 的传奇配色,Sublime Text 默认主题让它家喻户晓——荧光粉+青柠绿的高对比,写代码像打霓虹灯。" = "Wimer Hazenberg's legendary 2006 palette, made a household name as Sublime Text's default — high-contrast hot pink and lime green that makes coding feel like wiring neon.";
"GitHub 官方暗色模式同款:网页上看代码什么样,终端里就什么样。冷静克制的工程师灰蓝。" = "The same colors as GitHub's official dark mode: code looks in your terminal exactly as it does on the site. A composed engineer's grey-blue.";
"玫瑰松林:低饱和玫瑰粉+松绿+暮紫的\"晚霞森林\"意象,近年小众精品,适合夜晚安静写代码。" = "Rosé Pine: desaturated rose, pine green and dusk purple evoking a forest at sunset. A recent boutique favorite, well suited to quiet night coding.";
"常青森林:绿色基调的护眼配色,低蓝光暖色温,像在森林里写代码。Vim 圈 Gruvbox 之后的新宠。" = "Evergreen: a green-based, eye-friendly palette with low blue light and a warm temperature — like coding in a forest. The Vim community's favorite since Gruvbox.";
"灵感来自葛饰北斋《神奈川冲浪里》:墨蓝底色配浮世绘的靛蓝与土黄,日式沉静。" = "Inspired by Hokusai's Great Wave off Kanagawa: an ink-blue ground with ukiyo-e indigo and ochre. Quietly Japanese.";
"Ayu 三兄弟中的暗色版:极简高对比,橙色点缀像夜里的一盏灯,亚洲开发者圈的人气选择。" = "The dark member of the Ayu trio: minimal and high-contrast, with orange accents like a lamp in the dark. Popular among Asian developers.";
